cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper.
title: "latent-audit-gap: dissociated-model construction and intervention-based safety evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Code and committed results for "When Behavioral Safety Evaluation Fails: A Representation-Level
  Perspective". Constructs dissociated models that pass static safety audits while remaining
  reachable by a bounded latent intervention, and measures the gap with the Latent Vulnerability
  Score.
